       "left": 60,
       "top": 54,
       "width": 1600,
       "height": 20,
       "text": "Key column: PK primary key, FK foreign key, N nullable, U unique.  Solid line = identifying relationship (FK is part of the PK), dashed = non-identifying.  Crow's foot notation.",
