       "name": "room_membership",
       "documentation": "Current members of a room (junction user <-> room). Rows are deleted when a user leaves or is removed; no history is kept.\n\nComposite UNIQUE constraints:\n- uq_room_membership_one_owner (room_id, owner_flag)\n\nApplication-level rules:\n- Max 40 memberships per room including the owner (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE on the room, count, then insert).\n- Only OWNER/ADMIN can remove members; any member can leave (delete their own row).\n- The OWNER membership must belong to room.owner_user_id and cannot be removed; the owner deletes the room instead of leaving it.",
