       "name": "quiz",
       "documentation": "Quiz owned permanently by its creator. Exists independently of rooms. is_in_library = FALSE marks a quiz created directly from a room, which is not shown in the creator's personal library.\n\nApplication-level rules:\n- Max 15 quizzes per creator.\n- creator_user_id is never updated.\n- Only the creator can delete the quiz and manage its collaborators; creator and collaborators can edit its content.\n- updated_at is refreshed whenever the quiz's questions, options, pairs or media change (ON UPDATE only covers the quiz row itself).",
