       "_id": "pZVAtqttSHN1d7kl",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "0YjnWj41WEhulMgu"
       },
       "name": "question",
       "documentation": "Question of a quiz with its own time limit and points. correct_text_answer holds the single accepted answer for OPEN_ANSWER and FILL_IN_THE_BLANK questions.\n\nComposite UNIQUE constraints:\n- uq_question_quiz_order (quiz_id, display_order)\n\nCHECK constraints:\n- chk_question_points: point_value > 0\n- chk_question_time_limit: time_limit_seconds > 0\n- chk_question_order: display_order BETWEEN 1 AND 25\n- chk_question_text_answer: (question_type IN ('OPEN_ANSWER','FILL_IN_THE_BLANK') AND correct_text_answer IS NOT NULL) OR (question_type NOT IN ('OPEN_ANSWER','FILL_IN_THE_BLANK') AND correct_text_answer IS NULL)\n\nApplication-level rules:\n- answer_option rows only for MULTIPLE_CHOICE / TRUE_FALSE; matching_pair rows only for MATCHING.\n- MULTIPLE_CHOICE: 2..10 options, exactly one correct.\n- TRUE_FALSE: exactly two options ('TRUE','FALSE'), exactly one correct.\n- MATCHING: at least 2 pairs.\n- A quiz can be PUBLISHED only if every question has a complete correct answer.",
       "ownedElements": [
        {
         "_type": "ERDRelationship",
         "_id": "ZkYxeaE2ZnEW3/mK",
         "_parent": {
          "$ref": "pZVAtqttSHN1d7kl"
