       "name": "user_answer",
       "documentation": "Answer submitted by a participant to one question, with its evaluated correctness and points.\n\nComposite UNIQUE constraints:\n- uq_user_answer_attempt_question (attempt_id, question_id)\n\nApplication-level rules:\n- question must belong to the session's quiz.\n- By question type: selected_option_id for MULTIPLE_CHOICE / TRUE_FALSE, text_answer for OPEN_ANSWER / FILL_IN_THE_BLANK, user_answer_match rows for MATCHING (not a CHECK: MySQL forbids CHECK on a column used by a SET NULL foreign key).\n- Answers are accepted only within the question's time limit.",
